---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { gmApplications, nextEventWindow } from '../data/events';
import { longDate } from '../lib/format';
---

<Layout
  title="GM Information - OZ ORC Adelaide | Resources for Game Masters"
  description="Essential information for Game Masters running games at OZ ORC. Find resources, safety tools, and what to bring to Adelaide's premier OSR gaming convention."
>
  <section class="bg-base-200 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">GM INFORMATION</h1>
        <p class="text-lg">
          Resources and guidelines for Game Masters at OZ ORC
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title text-2xl mb-4">Support & Resources</h2>

            <div class="mb-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Safety Tools</h3>
              <p class="mb-4">
                In a convention environment, GMs will often be running games for
                strangers with varied backgrounds and experiences. If you're
                interested in learning about tools to help facilitate games in
                these situations, here are some excellent resources:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">→</span>
                  <a href="/code-of-conduct" class="link link-primary">
                    OZ ORC Code of Conduct
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">→</span>
                  <a
                    href="https://ttrpgsafetytoolkit.com"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="link link-primary"
                  >
                    TTRPG Safety Toolkit
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">→</span>
                  <a
                    href="https://slyflourish.com/safety_tools.html"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="link link-primary"
                  >
                    Sly Flourish's Guide to Safety Tools
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">→</span>
                  <a
                    href="https://montecookgames.com/consent-in-gaming/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="link link-primary"
                  >
                    Monte Cook Games: Consent in Gaming
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Contact</h3>
              <p>
                If you have any questions or need assistance, please reach out
                to the organizers at{' '}
                <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="link link-primary">
                  {site.email}
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">GM FAQ</h2>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                checked
                aria-label="When and where is the next event?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                When and where is the next event?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  Adelaide, {nextEventWindow}. The exact date, venue and game
                  slot times are still being confirmed. We'll share them with
                  the GM mailing list and on our{' '}
                  <a
                    href={site.socials.discord}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="link link-primary"
                  >
                    Discord
                  </a>{' '}
                  as soon as they're locked in.
                  {
                    gmApplications &&
                      ` GM applications close ${longDate(gmApplications.closes)}.`
                  }
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="Do GMs get free entry?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                Do GMs get free entry?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>Yes! GMs get free entry to the convention.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="What do I need to prepare?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                What do I need to prepare?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  Your scenario, plus anything else you need to run it. The
                  standard is that GMs provide pre-generated characters. If your
                  game needs something different, such as players rolling up
                  characters at the table, tell us in the Description of your
                  application.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="How many applications should I submit?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                How many applications should I submit?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  One for each session you'd like to run. In each application,
                  tick every game slot you'd be happy to run that session in,
                  and we'll confirm which one you get. If you'd like to run the
                  same game twice, submit two applications.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="Can I be a standby GM?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                Can I be a "standby" GM?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  Definitely! Fill in a{' '}
                  <a href="/gm-submission" class="link link-primary">
                    game application
                  </a>{' '}
                  and select "Standby" for your game slot. Standby games are called
                  up if we get extra players or a GM has to pull out late.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="I don't have a name for my session but I have an idea. Can I still apply?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                I don't have a name for my session but I have an idea. Can I
                still apply?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  Yes! Put "TBA" in the Scenario field and tell us about your
                  idea in the Description.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="I don't know what to put for Content Warnings. Can I still apply?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                I don't know what to put for "Content Warnings". Can I still
                apply?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  You sure can. Put "Unsure" and our friendly team will help you
                  work it out.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="collapse collapse-plus bg-base-100">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="gm-faq-accordion"
                aria-label="I'm a GM who's unsure about running a game at OZ ORC. What should I do?"
              />
              <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium">
                I'm a GM who's unsure about running a game at OZ ORC. What
                should I do?
              </div>
              <div class="collapse-content">
                <p>
                  Join our{' '}
                  <a
                    href={site.socials.discord}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="link link-primary"
                  >
                    Discord
                  </a>{' '}
                  and get talking with the community, or email{' '}
                  <a href={`mailto:${site.gmEmail}`} class="link link-primary">
                    {site.gmEmail}
                  </a>{' '}
                  to join the GM mailing list. We're very friendly and would love
                  to help you figure out what's the best fit for you.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-8">
          <a href="/gm-submission" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Submit Your Game
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
